Open a multi-line file, put the cursor near the top, scroll down with the mouse
(button 1 in the scrollbar) so the cursor moves off the top of the window, then
type a character. onethird is called with the new cursor off-screen, so its
keep-the-cursor-visible scroll body runs.

-- file --
this is line number 1
this is line number 2
this is line number 3
this is line number 4
this is line number 5
this is line number 6
this is line number 7
this is line number 8
this is line number 9
this is line number 10
